<title>SWITZERLAND: Pilot killed when Swiss fighter crashes.</title>
<headline>Pilot killed when Swiss fighter crashes.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Swiss Mirage fighter jet crashed in western Switzerland on Thursday, killing the pilot, the defense ministry in Berne said.</p>
<p>The cause of the crash near Ste Croix in the western canton of Vaud was still under investigation.</p>
